p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 158%; margin-left: 19.3pt; text-indent: -19.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">정책현장과 학문사이의 가교역할을 도모하여 문화정책 발전에 기여할 수 있도록 연구자 여러분의 많은 관심과 참여를 부탁드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 158%; margin-left: 19.3pt; text-indent: -19.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 158%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 158%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">공모분야 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">문화예술</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">문화유산</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">콘텐츠산업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">미디어</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">지역문화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">문화교류</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">여가문화 등</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 158%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">접수마감 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 2022. 02. 13.(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) 18:00</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 158%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">접수방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: http://kcti.jams.or.kr (</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">논문투고 및 심사시스템</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 158%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">제 출 물 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">투고 신청서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">투고 논문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">인적사항 삭제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">), KCI </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">문헌 유사도 검사 결과 확인서</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 158%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">발 행 일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 2022. 04. 30(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 158%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">바</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">기타 사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 158%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">투고 신청서 및 발간규정은 연구원 홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(https://www.kcti.re.kr)</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">에서 확인</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 158%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp; ·&nbsp;KCTI </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">발간물 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&gt; </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">문화정책논총</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">학술지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) &gt; </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">투고안내</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 158%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">논문 투고 시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, KCI(https://www.kci.go.kr) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">문헌 유사도 검사 결과확인서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">업로드</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">필수</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 158%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">논문 투고 시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;mso-hansi-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">『</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">문화정책논총</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;mso-hansi-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">』</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">게재 논문 인용 권장</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 158%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;mso-hansi-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">『</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">문화정책논총</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;mso-hansi-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">』</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">게재 논문은 한국학술지인용색인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(KCI), DBPIA</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">의 학술정보서비스로 제공</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 158%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">영문 논문 투고 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">영문 논문 및 초록 감수 제공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 158%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 158%;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 158%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 158%;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">붙임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;mso-hansi-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">『</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">문화정책논총</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;mso-hansi-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">』</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso